# Running app

The updated app is already running at `http://127.0.0.1:8787/pathways/`. Earlier app servers were stopped intentionally. Keep the current app on port 8787. Make changes in the existing project and verify them by refreshing this route.

- Do not start a second server on 8787.
- Do not treat an earlier stopped server as a failure to fix.
- After a change, refresh `http://127.0.0.1:8787/pathways/` instead of launching a new process.
